\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 Question 1 of 6: What is HAL Core responsible for?\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf0 1A. Request intake\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 HAL Core needs a single front door for requests coming from Otacon, the dashboard, phones, future glasses, automations, and other clients.\
