\f1\b \cf0 My recommendation:
\f0\b0  HAL Core should expose one internal API. Every client sends requests to Core rather than talking directly to a GX10.\
That keeps clients simple and lets Core decide where work should run.\
Do you agree that 
\f1\b all client requests should go through HAL Core
\f0\b0 , with no direct client-to-node communication?\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
