\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 My recommendation\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 HAL Core owns the desired state.
\f0\b0 \
Each HAL Node runs a very small 
\f1\b HAL Agent
\f0\b0 .\
The HAL Agent's job is intentionally boring:\
