\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 Why I recommend this\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 I want 
\f1\b one brain
\f0\b0  in the entire system.\
Not three.\
The GX10s should never decide anything important.\
They should be extremely predictable workers.\
Think of it like Kubernetes\'97but without Kubernetes.\
HAL Core is the control plane.\
HAL Agents are the workers.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

