\f1\b\fs48 \cf0 Question 1D: Model Management\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 This is, in my opinion, the single most important architectural decision we'll make.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 The question\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 Who owns the models?
\f0\b0 \
Not the files\'97the 
\f3\i state
\f0\i0  of the models.\
For example:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls7\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Which models are installed?\
