\
Qwen3-235B\
    Loaded on gx10-02\
    Using 72 GB VRAM\
\
Whisper Large\
    Loaded on gx10-01\
    Shared by all clients\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf0 The nodes don't "decide" anything.\
