\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Before meetings 
\f5 \uc0\u8594 
\f0  summarization model.\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 When your glasses are active 
