\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 20 substantial conversations per week\
\ls15\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 10,000 tokens per conversation\
\ls15\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 for 20 years\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 That would be about 
\f1\b 208 million tokens
\f0\b0 . The original text would be under 
