\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 \strokec2 Layer 3 \'97 Episodic Memory\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 This is my favorite layer.\
HAL remembers 
\f1\b events
\f0\b0 , not just facts.\
Examples:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 "The day HAL replaced RossOS."\
