Not just searchable text.\
Actual milestones.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 One design principle I'd like to add\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 I think this is worth making a first-class rule.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 \strokec2 The archive is immutable.
\f0\b0 \strokec2 \

\f1\b \strokec2 The Memory Graph is editable.
\f0\b0 \strokec2 \
That distinction is incredibly important.\
The archive is history.\
The graph is understanding.\
Understanding improves over time.\
History should not.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

