\cf0 What\'92s your recommendation for HAL core responsible for?\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 My recommendation is that 
\f1\b HAL Core should be responsible for every decision that requires system-wide context
\f0\b0 .\
The nodes should execute. Clients should request. The NAS should persist. 
\f1\b HAL Core should decide.
\f0\b0 \
