For example:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \'93What does this mean?\'94\
HAL might infer that it needs to:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls22\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Identify what \'93this\'94 refers to.\
