\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 3. Capability and model orchestration\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 Clients request outcomes, not models.\
HAL Core should:\
