\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 7. Tool and action orchestration\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 Models should not directly control your infrastructure, email, calendar, smart home, files, or future devices.\
