\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 10. User-facing continuity\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 HAL Core should preserve the sense that the user is interacting with 
\f1\b one coherent intelligence
\f0\b0 , even though many models and machines may contribute.\
Otacon should not feel like a collection of disconnected services. HAL Core maintains:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls29\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Conversational continuity\
\ls29\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Personality and response policies\
\ls29\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Context across devices\
\ls29\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Consistent permissions\
\ls29\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 A single identity and memory\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 What HAL Core should not do\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 HAL Core should not perform heavy inference itself unless that is deliberately useful for a lightweight task. It should also avoid storing large source files locally when the NAS is available.\
In simple terms:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f4\fs26 \cf0 Clients invoke.\
HAL Core understands and decides.\
HAL Nodes compute.\
HAL Memory preserves.\
Tools act.\
Otacon communicates.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf0 That is the boundary I would lock for 
\f1\b HAL Core v0.1
\f0\b0 . It is broad enough to support the long-term vision, while the first implementation can begin with only request intake, intent routing, node health, model selection, and basic workflow execution.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
